      "worked": "Since $P(a,b)$ lies on the original graph, $f(a)=b$. Set the transformed argument equal to $a$:\n$$\\begin{align*}2x+1&=a\\\\x&=\\frac{a-1}{2}\\\\y&=\\frac{b-1}{2}\\end{align*}$$\nThe new coordinates are $\\left(\\frac{a-1}{2},\\frac{b-1}{2}\\right)$.",
